From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adeeb Shihadeh <adeeb@comma.ai>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 19:49:39 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] clk: qcom: gcc-sdm845: don't keep the MMNOC TBU GDSCs on
 until sync_state

The bootloader leaves the HLOS1 votes for the three MMNOC SMMU TBU GDSCs
set. Since commit 0e789b491ba0 ("pmdomain: core: Leave powered-on genpds
on until sync_state") genpd keeps such domains on until the provider's
sync_state(). On boards where that never happens (on SDM845 the GMU is
never bound to a driver, so GCC's sync_state stays pending), the votes
are held forever, even though the TBU devices are runtime suspended and
nothing asked for them.

A powered MMNOC TBU is not safe without a bandwidth vote on the MMNOC.
Once the last MMNOC HF user (usually the display) drops its votes, MM1
goes to zero in the RPMh sleep set, and the next time the CPU cluster
enters its RSC sleep state the whole SoC stops: no lockup report, no
watchdog pretimeout, only the PMIC watchdog bite ~30 s later. On the
comma four this happens every time the DSI display is turned off through
KMS. Keeping the TBU GDSCs off avoids it, and so does holding any MM1
vote in the sleep bucket; powering only the three TBU GDSCs back on
brings the hang back.

The HLOS votes aren't needed for translation; the downstream kernel
leaves them off and sets them only around TBU debug register access,
together with an MMNOC vote, which is what the qcom TBU driver does
upstream as well. Let genpd turn them off at boot like any other unused
domain.

Fixes: 0e789b491ba0 ("pmdomain: core: Leave powered-on genpds on until sync_state")
Signed-off-by: Adeeb Shihadeh <adeeb@comma.ai>
---
 drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-sdm845.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-sdm845.c b/drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-sdm845.c
index 6d0f9cede5..2c0ef15172 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-sdm845.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-sdm845.c
@@ -3496,6 +3496,7 @@ static struct gdsc hlos1_vote_mmnoc_mmu_tbu_hf0_gdsc = {
 	.gdscr = 0x7d040,
 	.pd = {
 		.name = "hlos1_vote_mmnoc_mmu_tbu_hf0_gdsc",
+		.flags = GENPD_FLAG_NO_STAY_ON,
 	},
 	.pwrsts = PWRSTS_OFF_ON,
 	.flags = VOTABLE,
@@ -3505,6 +3506,7 @@ static struct gdsc hlos1_vote_mmnoc_mmu_tbu_hf1_gdsc = {
 	.gdscr = 0x7d048,
 	.pd = {
 		.name = "hlos1_vote_mmnoc_mmu_tbu_hf1_gdsc",
+		.flags = GENPD_FLAG_NO_STAY_ON,
 	},
 	.pwrsts = PWRSTS_OFF_ON,
 	.flags = VOTABLE,
@@ -3514,6 +3516,7 @@ static struct gdsc hlos1_vote_mmnoc_mmu_tbu_sf_gdsc = {
 	.gdscr = 0x7d044,
 	.pd = {
 		.name = "hlos1_vote_mmnoc_mmu_tbu_sf_gdsc",
+		.flags = GENPD_FLAG_NO_STAY_ON,
 	},
 	.pwrsts = PWRSTS_OFF_ON,
 	.flags = VOTABLE,
